      "id": "claim_d617c4883ed1484189ce1f493ffa8659",
      "statement": "On the initial resume connection, `ServerReady` latches `_resuming` into `_restoring_resumed_history` before clearing connection state, keeping the status in resuming state through history restoration; reconnects do not re-arm that indicator or repeat initial session setup.",
