    {
      "id": "claim_a5a5468634bc49ac8ea6b0a0e33783b1",
      "statement": "For a streamed execution, `make_graph` requires a nonempty thread ID and workspace context, verifies the durable workspace binding, and selects a workspace runtime keyed by binding identity and current runtime fingerprint; access-policy drift is rejected while runtime-only changes can rebuild the graph.",
